# Original Marble Recovery level (2026-10-04). Not derived from any Marble Madness course.
# Everything so far at once: a long switchback descent, a gulper pacing the far edge
# of the first landing (brake, or meet it), a slime chicane on the last bridge, then a two-unit drop to the socket.
